# text = In the meantime , Mrs Podsnap , unable to originate a mistake on her own account , because Mrs Veneering is the only other lady there , does her best in the way of handsomely supporting her husband's , by looking towards Mr Twemlow with a plaintive countenance and remarking to Mrs Veneering in a feeling manner , firstly , that she fears he has been rather bilious of late , and , secondly , that the baby is already very like him .
