# text = In and out among vessels that seemed to have got ashore , and houses that seemed to have got afloat -- among bow-splits staring into windows , and windows staring into ships -- the wheels rolled on , until they stopped at a dark corner , river-washed and otherwise not washed at all , where the boy alighted and opened the door He spoke in the singular number , to the express exclusion of Eugene said Mortimer , slipping over the stones and refuse on the shore , as the boy turned the corner sharp
