# text = On a certain day , some wretched infant having purchased the damp gingerbread-horse ( fearfully out of condition ), and the adhesive bird-cage , which had been exposed for the day's sale , he had taken a tin box from under his stool to produce a relay of those dreadful specimens , and was going to look in at the lid , when he said to himself , pausing The words referred to a broad , round-shouldered , one-sided old fellow in mourning , coming comically ambling towards the corner , dressed in a pea over-coat , and carrying a large stick .
