# text = Silas , who had stimulated this anxiety by his hard reserve of manner , and who had begun to understand his man very well , replied with an air ; as if he were saying something extraordinarily generous and great said Mr Boffin , admiringly Mr Boffin seemed a little unprepared for this conclusion , but assented , with the remark and again shook hands with him upon it he then demanded said Mr Wegg , careful to leave all the eagerness to him said Mr Boffin inquired Silas said Mr Boffin slightly disappointed Mr Boffin went over these stones slowly and with much caution said Mr Wegg , nodding his head with an air of friendly recognition Mr Wegg made answer , ' having been otherways employed , Mr Boffin .
