# text = This occasioned a quick change in the spirits of a hoarse gentleman and a donkey , whom he had much perplexed said the hoarse gentleman , who was driving his donkey in a truck , with a carrot for a whip Mr Wegg complied , and the hoarse gentleman invited his attention to the third person in company , thus Mr Wegg whispered Edward , with his ears lying back , remained immoveable Edward instantly pricked up his ears to their utmost , and rattled off at such a pace that Mr Wegg's conversation was jolted out of him in a most dislocated state asked Mr Wegg , holding on returned his escort asked Wegg asked Wegg The effect of the name was so very alarming , in respect of causing a temporary disappearance of Edward's head , casting his hind hoofs in the air , greatly accelerating the pace and increasing the jolting , that Mr Wegg was fain to devote his attention exclusively to holding on , and to relinquish his desire of ascertaining whether this homage to Boffin was to be considered complimentary or the reverse .
