# text = And now , Mr Wegg at length pushed away his plate and put on his spectacles , and Mr Boffin lighted his pipe and looked with beaming eyes into the opening world before him , and Mrs Boffin reclined in a fashionable manner on her sofa : as one who would be part of the audience if she found she could , and would go to sleep if she found she couldn't began Wegg here he looked hard at the book , and stopped said Wegg with an air of insinuating frankness ( having first again looked hard at the book Mr Wegg was faltering and in danger of breaking down , when a bright thought flashed upon him Mr Wegg thus came out of his disadvantage with quite a chivalrous air , and not only that , but by dint of repeating with a manly delicacy turned the disadvantage on Boffin , who felt that he had committed himself in a very painful manner .
