# text = Miss Abbey knitted her brow at him , as he darkly leered at her was the involuntary exclamation of Miss Potterson returned the other , stretching forward over the half door to throw his words into the bar ; for his voice was as if the head of his boat's mop were down his throat With that flourish , and seeming to have talked himself rather more drunk and much more ferocious than he had begun by being , Mr Riderhood took up his pint pot and swaggered off to the taproom .
