# text = Lizzie , following him , arrived as one of the two female domestics of the Fellowship Porters arranged on the snug little table by the bar fire , Miss Potterson's supper of hot sausages and mashed potatoes said Miss Abbey said Miss Abbey , pushing away the untasted dish quoth Miss Abbey , sharply With an alacrity that seemed no less referable to the pepperer fact than to the supper fact , Bob obeyed , and his boots were heard descending towards the bed of the river then began Miss Potterson Lizzie pleaded said Miss Abbey , pettishly Lizzie merely answered this difficult question with an apologetic glance resumed Miss Potterson remarked Miss Potterson , rubbing her vexed nose she repeated , opening her eyes
