# text = Carrying these with Lizzie's aid , he passed up to his dwelling Something suggestive in their colour , and perhaps in her face , struck him as he held them up ; he turned his shoulder and held them down to the fire said Gaffer , dropping the liquor into his cup from a squat black bottle , and dropping it slowly that it might seem more But , he perceived that he was evaded , and , having thrown a hasty angry glance towards the bunk , plucked at a corner of her apron and asked He looked at her , stirred his tea and took two or three gulps , then cut at his piece of hot steak with his case-knife , and said , eating said the parent , shaking his knife in the air said the parent again , with his former action said the father , again emphasizing his words with the knife He had pushed away his plate .
