# text = Not , however , towards the ' shops' where cunning artificers work in pearls and diamonds and gold and silver , making their hands so rich , that the enriched water in which they wash them is bought for the refiners ;-- not towards these does Mr Wegg stump , but towards the poorer shops of small retail traders in commodities to eat and drink and keep folks warm , and of Italian frame-makers , and of barbers , and of brokers , and of dealers in dogs and singing-birds .
