# text = This consideration seems to have its effect on the boy , for he goes out grumbling sighs Mr Venus , heavily , snuffing the candle Having so held and waved the candle as that all these heterogeneous objects seemed to come forward obediently when they were named , and then retire again , Mr Venus despondently repeats resumes his seat , and with drooping despondency upon him , falls to pouring himself out more tea asks Mr Wegg replies Venus , blowing his tea : his head and face peering out of the darkness , over the smoke of it , as if he were modernizing the old original rise in his family Silas puts his point in the improved form of replies Venus , still blowing his tea Wegg reasons persuasively Repressing an indignant look , indicative of anything but a disposition to excuse him , Silas pursues his point Mr Venus takes gulps of hot tea , shutting his eyes at every gulp , and opening them again in a spasmodic manner ; but does not commit himself to assent says Wegg , feelingly Fain to accept his promise , and wishing to propitiate him , Mr Wegg looks on as he sighs and pours himself out more tea , and then says , trying to get a sympathetic tone into his voice Mr Venus thus delivers hmself , his right hand extended , his smoking saucer in his left hand , protesting as though he were going to burst into a flood of tears remarks Silas ( though not quite so readily as last time Silas receives one from his hand , which Venus takes from a wonderful litter in a drawer , and putting on his spectacles , reads with a groan Here Silas is rather alarmed by Mr Venus's springing to his feet in the hurry of his spirits , and haggardly confronting him with his hand on his coat collar ; but Mr Venus , begging pardon , sits down again , saying , with the calmness of despair Mr Venus pours himself out more tea , with a look and in an attitude of the deepest desolation Having repeated the fatal expressions , Mr Venus drinks more tea by gulps , and offers an explanation of his doing so says Silas , rising said Mr Venus Mr Wegg admits that he is bound for that port says Silas Mr Wegg does not know , but he makes as if he did , by responsively nodding his head .
