# text = And he was still jogging along Fleet Street in this condition of mind , when he became aware that he was closely tracked and observed by a man of genteel appearance said Mr Boffin , stopping short , with his meditations brought to an abrupt check Mr Boffin looked full at the man , and the man looked full at him said Mr Boffin , after a glance at the pavement , as if it were made of faces and he were trying to match the man's said the stranger muttered Mr Boffin said Mr Boffin
