# text = There may have been a momentary mantling in the face of the man as he made the last answer , but it passed directly demanded Mr Boffin , rather angry thought Mr Boffin With this discreet reflection , and carrying his stick in his arms much as Punch carries his , Mr Boffin turned into Clifford's Inn aforesaid thought Mr Boffin was Mr Boffin's answer , as he surveyed his new friend again .
