# text = Sparrows were there , cats were there , dry-rot and wet-rot were there , but it was not otherwise a suggestive spot said the stranger , producing a little pocket-book and taking out a card Mr Boffin stared again said he Now , this name had been more or less in Mr Boffin's thoughts all the morning , and for days before ; therefore he said unconsciously staring again , past all bounds of good manners , with the card in his hand said Mr Boffin returned Mr Rokesmith said Mr Boffin Again Mr Boffin's eyes opened wide , and he stared at the applicant from head to foot , repeating repeated Mr Boffin , meditating upon the word Mr Rokesmith answered , evidently having heard it with surprise returned Mr Boffin , with a confidential sense of dignity Without observing that these duties seemed by no means clear to Mr Rokesmith's astonished comprehension , Mr Boffin went on repeated Mr Rokesmith , seeming to have caught the sound imperfectly returned Mr Boffin , with great presence of mind
