# text = After waiting some quarter of an hour alone in the family sitting - room , which presented traces of having been so hastily arranged after a meal , that one might have doubted whether it was made tidy for visitors , or cleared for blindman's buff , Mr and Mrs Boffin became aware of the entrance of Mrs Wilfer , majestically faint , and with a condescending stitch in her side : which was her company manner said Mrs Wilfer , after the first salutations , and as soon as she had adjusted the handkerchief under her chin , and waved her gloved hands returned Mr Boffin returned Mrs Wilfer , with a dignified bend of her head pursued Mr Boffin , while Mrs Boffin added confirmatory nods and smiles said Mrs Wilfer
