# text = So , Twemlow goes home to Duke Street , St James's , to take a plate of mutton broth with a chop in it , and a look at the marriage - service , in order that he may cut in at the right place to-morrow ; and he is low , and feels it dull over the livery stable-yard , and is distinctly aware of a dint in his heart , made by the most adorable of the adorable bridesmaids .
