# text = And so , Lady Tippins , quite undetermined whether today is the day before yesterday , or the day after to-morrow , or the week after next , fades away ; and Mortimer Lightwood and Eugene fade away , and Twemlow fades away , and the stoney aunt goes away -- she declines to fade , proving rock to the last -- and even the unknowns are slowly strained off , and it is all over .
