# text = The foreign gentleman said A youngish sallowish gentleman in spectacles , with a lumpy forehead , seated in a supplementary chair at a corner of the table , here caused a profound sensation by saying , in a raised voice and then stopping dead said the foreign gentleman , turning towards him But the gentleman with the lumpy forehead having for the time delivered himself of all that he found behind his lumps , spake for the time no more said Mr Podsnap , resuming the thread of his discourse
