# text = But the lumpy gentleman , unwilling to give it up , again madly said and again spake no more Mr Podsnap explained , with a sense of meritorious proprietorship the foreign gentleman was beginning , when Mr Podsnap put him right again said the foreign gentleman returned Mr Podsnap , gravely shaking his head said the foreign gentleman , laughing assented Mr Podsnap added Mr Podsnap , looking round upon his compatriots , and sounding solemnly with his theme Having delivered this little summary , Mr Podsnap's face flushed , as he thought of the remote possibility of its being at all qualified by any prejudiced citizen of any other country ; and , with his favourite right-arm flourish , he put the rest of Europe and the whole of Asia , Africa , and America nowhere .
