# text = As Mr Podsnap stood with his back to the drawing-room fire , pulling up his shirtcollar , like a veritable cock of the walk literally pluming himself in the midst of his possessions , nothing would have astonished him more than an intimation that Miss Podsnap , or any other young person properly born and bred , could not be exactly put away like the plate , brought out like the plate , polished like the plate , counted , weighed , and valued like the plate .
