# text = They showed the visitor to be an ill - looking visitor with a squinting leer , who , as he spoke , fumbled at an old sodden fur cap , formless and mangey , that looked like a furry animal , dog or cat , puppy or kitten , drowned and decaying said Mortimer returned the man , in what he meant to be a wheedling tone ducking at him with a servile air The visitor , clearly anything but reliant on this assurance , doggedly muttered asked Lightwood returned the man Which Eugene , smoking and contemplating him , interpreted as meaning Affidavit said Lightwood , with his indolent laugh Eugene explained Much discomfited by this information , the visitor turned the drowned dog or cat , puppy or kitten , about and about , and looked from one of the Governors Both to the other of the Governors Both , while he deeply considered within himself .
