# text = And forasmuch as crouching under the lee of a hauled-up boat on a night when it blew cold and strong , and when the weather was varied with blasts of hail at times , might be wearisome to amateurs , the reporter closed with the recommendation that the two gentlemen should remain , for a while at any rate , in their present quarters , which were weather-tight and warm .
