# text = But he had used the word in the sense of Steward returned Mr Boffin , with his hand still to his chin Mr Rokesmith again explained ; defining the duties he sought to undertake , as those of general superintendent , or manager , or overlooker , or man of business said Mr Boffin , in his pouncing way with a glance and a half-smile at the table Mr Boffin rubbed his inky ear , and looked at his wife said Mr Boffin , slowly crumpling his own blotted note in his hand No sooner said than done .
