# text = Relinquishing his hat and gloves , Mr Rokesmith sat down quietly at the table , arranged the open papers into an orderly heap , cast his eyes over each in succession , folded it , docketed it on the outside , laid it in a second heap , and , when that second heap was complete and the first gone , took from his pocket a piece of string and tied it together with a remarkably dexterous hand at a running curve and a loop said Mr Boffin John Rokesmith read his abstracts aloud .
