# text = As much as to say said Miss Bella , loftily A covert glance at her face , as he walked beside her , showed him that she had not expected his ready assent to that proposition she inquired , as if that would be a drawback drawled Bella , in a tone of mortification said Bella , again with her eyebrows raised , and her eyelids drooping Without replying on this point , Mr Rokesmith went on was Miss Bella's mental exclamation said Miss Bella , haughtily Mr Rokesmith inclined his head in a deprecatory manner , and went on As he watched her with another covert look , he saw a certain ambitious triumph in her face which no assumed coldness could conceal said the Secretary with deference returned the young lady
