# text = The discreet Mrs Wilfer now looking out of window and beholding her daughter in conference with her lodger , instantly tied up her head and came out for a casual walk said John Rokesmith , as the majestic lady came stalking up returned Mrs Wilfer , waving her gloves in her chronic state of dignity , and vague ill-usage said Rokesmith returned Mrs Wilfer said Mrs Wilfer , with a grand shrug of her shoulders , and another wave of her gloves Here Miss Bella offered the remonstrance said Mrs Wilfer repeated Mrs Wilfer , with a vast access of grandeur with a shiver said Rokesmith , with a glance at Bella returned Mrs Wilfer , with dreadful solemnity pursued Mrs Wilfer , who clearly had not had the faintest idea of saying anything more
