# text = The Secretary learns , too , that confidence between man and wife would seem to obtain but rarely when virtue is in distress , so numerous are the wives who take up their pens to ask Mr Boffin for money without the knowledge of their devoted husbands , who would never permit it ; while , on the other hand , so numerous are the husbands who take up their pens to ask Mr Boffin for money without the knowledge of their devoted wives , who would instantly go out of their senses if they had the least suspicion of the circumstance .
