# text = The obedient figure began to rummage in its pockets said the person of the house Such a business as he made of collecting it from his dogs' - eared pockets ; of expecting it in this pocket , and not finding it ; of not expecting it in that pocket , and passing it over ; of finding no pocket where that other pocket ought to be demanded the person of the house , when a confused heap of pence and shillings lay on the table was the rueful answer , with an accordant shake of the head cried the person of the house .
