# text = In the moment of his taking his hat off , Podsnap , as per agreement made with Mrs Veneering , telegraphs to that wife and mother Veneering loses his way in the usual No Thoroughfares of speech , and Podsnap and Twemlow say Hear hear ! and sometimes , when he can't by any means back himself out of some very unlucky No Thoroughfare with an air of facetious conviction , as if the ingenuity of the thing gave them a sensation of exquisite pleasure .
