# text = Mr Lammle's utmost powers of sparkling were in requisition to-day , for Fascination Fledgeby and Georgiana not only struck each other speechless , but struck each other into astonishing attitudes ; Georgiana , as she sat facing Fledgeby , making such efforts to conceal her elbows as were totally incompatible with the use of a knife and fork ; and Fledgeby , as he sat facing Georgiana , avoiding her countenance by every possible device , and betraying the discomposure of his mind in feeling for his whiskers with his spoon , his wine glass , and his bread .
