# text = He struck it by saying , partly to Mrs Lammle and partly to the circumambient air As he stopped dead , Mr Lammle , making that gingerous bush of his whiskers to look out of , offered him the word said Fledgeby To which Georgiana replied , hooking her two little fingers in one another , and addressing the tablecloth Content perforce with this success for the time , Mr Lammle let Miss Podsnap out of the room , as if he were opening her cage door , and Mrs Lammle followed .
