# text = Present on the table , one scanty pot of tea , one scanty loaf , two scanty pats of butter , two scanty rashers of bacon , two pitiful eggs , and an abundance of handsome china bought a secondhand bargain asked Mr Lammle said Fledgeby , very deliberately said Fledgeby said Fledgeby Mr Lammle sparkled at him , but frowned at him too said Fledgeby remarked Lammle , darkening said Fascination Fledgeby , calmly feeling for his whisker Mr Lammie fell back upon propitiation returned Fledgeby , with an internal chuckle replied Fledgeby , with another internal chuckle rejoined Lammle , with a flourish of frankness , and a laugh , and stretching out his hands as if to show the universe a remarkable man in Fledgeby remarked Fascination , shaking his head slyly Alfred Lammle pushed his plate away ( no great sacrifice under the circumstances of there being so little in it ), thrust his hands in his pockets , leaned back in his chair , and contemplated Fledgeby in silence .
