# text = Now , Fledgeby , though not shabby , did look mean said Fledgeby , scratching his head with the brim of his hat the old man represented with a grave and patient air answered the old man with a smile remarked Fascination Fledgeby returned the old man with quiet emphasis Rather dashed , Fascination Fledgeby took another scratch at his intellectual head with his hat , to gain time for rallying he resumed , as though it were he who had spoken last said the old man , raising his eyes from the ground with his former smile returned Fledgeby
