# text = But looking at the old man as he stood quiet with his bead bowed and his eyes cast down , he felt that to relinquish an inch of his baldness , an inch of his grey hair , an inch of his coat-skirt , an inch of his hat-brim , an inch of his walking-staff , would be to relinquish hundreds of pounds said Fledgeby , mollified by these self-approving considerations Riah drew some folding tablets from his breast and noted it down continued Fledgeby in a grudging vein , as he got off the stool said Riah returned Fledgeby , with whom his growing rich on that stipend and gratitude was a very convenient fiction
