# text = He had founded himself upon Eugene when they were yet boys at school ; and at this hour imitated him no less , admired him no less , loved him no less , than in those departed days said he repeated Eugene returned the other murmured Eugene , with the air of one who was meditating deeply resumed Mortimer , disregarding the light interruption , and laying a hand upon Eugene's shoulder , as he , Mortimer , stood before him seated on his bed Eugene looked at him , but said nothing returned Eugene , after a serious pause of a few moments replied Eugene , shaking his head blankly , after pausing again to reconsider
