# text = The sister who is something too much upon your lips , perhaps -- is so very different from all the associations to which she had been used , and from all the low obscure people about her , that it is a very natural ambition said Bradley Headstone returned Eugene said Eugene , politely remarked Eugene remarked Eugene said the schoolmaster With a consciously bad grace and stiff manner , as Wrayburn looked so easily and calmly on , he went out with these words , and the heavy door closed like a furnace-door upon his red and white heats of rage said Eugene Mortimer Lightwood being still at the window , to which he had in delicacy withdrawn , Eugene called to him , and he fell to slowly pacing the room said Eugene , as he lighted another cigar replied Mortimer , still pacing the room inquired his unmoved friend said Lightwood , stopping said Eugene His friend made no direct reply , but observed , after a few whiffs of his cigar said Eugene , looking after him dubiously as he paced away to the other end of the room My dear Mortimer , not that tone of melancholy reproach , I entreat .
