# text = This last clause as a softening compliment to Mr Venus replies Venus , winking his weak eyes , and running his fingers through his dusty shock of hair says Mr Wegg , in a tone of sentimental condolence returns Venus Involuntarily making a pass with his wooden leg to guard himself as Mr Venus springs up in the emphasis of this unsociable declaration , Mr Wegg tilts over on his back , chair and all , and is rescued by that harmless misanthrope , in a disjointed state and ruefully rubbing his head says Venus , handing him his pipe grumbles Silas says Wegg argumentatively again rubbing his head Mr Wegg slowly subdues his ironical tone and his lingering irritation , and resumes his pipe returns Wegg , with a greedy relish with another roll of his eyes . '
