# text = Then , leaving this part of the subject , he remarks on the special phenomenon that before his installation in the Bower , it was from Mr Venus that he first heard of the legend of hidden wealth in the Mounds : ' which ', he observes with a vaguely pious air Lastly , he returns to the cause of the right , gloomily foreshadowing the possibility of something being unearthed to criminate Mr Boffin ( of whom he once more candidly admits it cannot be denied that he profits by a murder ), and anticipating his denunciation by the friendly movers to avenging justice .
