# text = When Mr Wegg , having finished , opens his arms wide , as if to show Mr Venus how bare his breast is , and then folds them pending a reply , Mr Venus winks at him with both eyes some little time before speaking he says when he does speak replies Wegg , a little dashed by the hint Wegg shakes his head observes Venus , after ruminating for a while Wegg naturally urges Wegg joyfully reproduces the two glasses , repeats the ceremony of clinking their rims , and inwardly drinks with great heartiness to the health and success in life of the young lady who has reduced Mr Venus to his present convenient state of mind .
