# text = She coloured under the retort -- so skilfully thrust , that the words seemed to be merely a plain answer , given in plain good faith -- and said , rather more emphatically and sharply replied the Secretary with his former air She was too quick in this petulant sally against ' Pa's lodger '; and she felt that she had been so when she met his quiet look said Bella , making haste to take refuge in ill - usage exclaimed Bella he replied with earnestness said Bella , looking at him as if he had reproved her he asked , hesitating He lingered a moment , as though to give her the opportunity of prolonging the conversation if she wished .
