# text = The footman who communicated this intelligence made a decent pause before uttering the name , to express that it was forced on his reluctance by the youth in question , and that if the youth had had the good sense and good taste to inherit some other name it would have spared the feelings of him the bearer said the Secretary in a perfectly composed way Mr Sloppy being introduced , remained close to the door : revealing in various parts of his form many surprising , confounding , and incomprehensible buttons said John Rokesmith , in a cheerful tone of welcome Sloppy explained that he had meant to come before , but that the Orphan ( of whom he made mention as Our Johnny ) had been ailing , and he had waited to report him well said the Secretary said Sloppy .
