# text = The completeness of his sympathy with her fancy for having a little John Harmon to protect and rear , he had shown in every act and word , and now that the kind fancy was disappointed , he treated it with a manly tenderness and respect for which she could hardly thank him enough said Mrs Boffin said Mrs Boffin John Rokesmith replied Not a bit better than he has , but that's his way ; he puts all the good upon me .
