# text = Bella felt a little vague trepidation as to the subject-matter of this same consultation , until Mrs Boffin announced it said that worthy soul , taking her comfortable place on a large ottoman in the centre of the room , and drawing her arm through Bella's murmured Mr Boffin , in an admiring parenthesis repeated Mrs Boffin , cordially beaming under the influence of her husband's compliment said Mr Boffin , gravely propounding a case for his Secretary's opinion said Rokesmith , gently said Bella , colouring remarked Mr Boffin , observant of the Secretary's face and again addressing him returned the Secretary said Mrs Boffin returned the Golden Dustman said Mrs Boffin cried Mr Boffin returned Mrs Boffin said Bella ; and perhaps she said it with some little sensitiveness arising out of those old curious relations of hers towards the murdered man returned Mrs Boffin , giving her a squeeze suggested Bella , musingly said Bella returned Mrs Boffin , stoutly said Bella returned Mrs Boffin Here the footman whose feelings had been hurt on the former occasion , appeared , and crossing to Rokesmith apologetically announced the objectionable Sloppy .
