# text = Putting this and that together -- combining under the head present appearances and the intimacy with Charley Hexam , and ranging under the head ' that ' the visit to his sister , the watchman reported to Miss Peecher his strong suspicions that the sister was at the bottom of it said Miss Peecher , as she sat making up her weekly report on a half-holiday afternoon Mary Anne , at her needlework , attendant and attentive , held her arm up returned Miss Peecher , in a tunefully instructive voice Mary Anne laid down her work , rose , hooked herself behind , as being under catechization , and replied Miss Peecher was going on , from the mere force of habit , when she checked herself ; on Mary Anne's evincing theological impatience to strike in with her godfathers and her godmothers , and said Miss Peecher was exceedingly sage here pursued Miss Peecher , complacent in her little transparent fiction of conducting the examination in a semiofficial manner for Mary Anne's benefit , not her own repeated Miss Peecher , as if possessed beforehand of the book in which it was written .
