# text = As a multitude of weak , imitative natures are always lying by , ready to go mad upon the next wrong idea that may be broached -- in these times , generally some form of tribute to Somebody for something that never was done , or , if ever done , that was done by Somebody Else -- so these less ordinary natures may lie by for years , ready on the touch of an instant to burst into flame .
