# text = It being Lizzie's regular occupation when they were alone of an evening to brush out and smooth the long fair hair of the dolls' dressmaker , she unfastened a ribbon that kept it back while the little creature was at her work , and it fell in a beautiful shower over the poor shoulders that were much in need of such adorning rain said Jenny With those words , she in her turn loosened her friend's dark hair , and it dropped of its own weight over her bosom , in two rich masses .
