# text = Pleasant had an eye for sailors , and she noticed the unused colour and texture of the hands , sunburnt though they were , as sharply as she noticed their unmistakable loosneness and suppleness , as he sat himself down with his left arm carelessly thrown across his left leg a little above the knee , and the right arm as carelessly thrown over the elbow of the wooden chair , with the hand curved , half open and half shut , as if it had just let go a rope Pleasant inquired , taking her observant stand on one side of the fire returned the man said the man assented Pleasant said the man , glancing round the place asked Pleasant , with a view to principal and interest
