# text = And in the nod and in the firm set of her mouth , there was a vigour of purpose not to be doubted said the Secretary returned old Betty said the Secretary said old Betty Higden the Secretary gently hinted , with a slight stress on the word said the old creature simply added the Secretary , as a comfort for her said Betty , cheerfully The Secretary felt that there was no gainsaying what was urged by this brave old heroine , and he presently repaired to Mrs Boffin and recommended her to let Betty Higden have her way , at all events for the time he said Mrs Boffin was not proof against the consideration set before her .
