# text = The heavy sigh was repeated as if by an echo , an hour afterwards , when Riah , who had been sitting on some dark steps in a corner over against the house , arose and went his patient way ; stealing through the streets in his ancient dress , like the ghost of a departed Time The estimable Twemlow , dressing himself in his lodgings over the stable-yard in Duke Street , Saint James's , and hearing the horses at their toilette below , finds himself on the whole in a disadvantageous position as compared with the noble animals at livery .
