# text = Say , little feeble grey personage , what thoughts are in thy breast to-day , of the Fancy -- so still to call her who bruised thy heart when it was green and thy head brown -- and whether it be better or worse , more painful or less , to believe in the Fancy to this hour , than to know her for a greedy armour - plated crocodile , with no more capacity of imagining the delicate and sensitive and tender spot behind thy waistcoat , than of going straight at it with a knitting-needle .
