# text = Having closed it on him , Fledgeby returned to Lammle , standing with his back to the bedroom fire , with one hand under his coat-skirts , and all his whiskers in the other said Fledgeby demanded Lammle replied Fledgeby in unintentional rhyme said Lammle remonstrated Fascination very slowly , and sitting down with his hands on his knees to stare at his glowering friend with his back to the fire repeated Lammle , with a sweep of his right arm demanded Fledgeby , as slowly as before , and more sternly Fledgeby took a note from his extended hand and read it aloud Fledgeby looked at the three blank sides of this note , quite as long and earnestly as at the first expressive side , and then looked at Lammle , who responded with another extensive sweep of his right arm said Fledgeby said Lammle suggested Fledgeby , after reflecting with a very discontented brow said Lammle , with a deeper frown .
