# text = The young man sat looking at the fire with a face of listening curiosity , ready to check him off and catch him tripping said Fledgeby Mr Fledgeby could only express the feelings to which this incredible statement gave rise in his breast , by a prodigiously long derisive sniff said the Jew said Fledgeby , distrustfully asked Fledgeby , feeling his cheek said the old man Fledgeby's eyes had come from the fire to notice the action of his hands when he said Fledgeby now tried ( very unsuccessfully ) to imitate that action , as he shook his head and said With one hand across his breast and the other on the easy chair , Riah , without justifying himself , waited for further questioning .
