# text = This he twice or thrice repeated with much complacency , as he again dispersed the legs of the Turkish trousers and bent the knees he then soliloquised Herein he was quite accurate ; it being his habit , not to jump , or leap , or make an upward spring , at anything in life , but to crawl at everything pursued Fledgeby , feeling for his whisker Another dry twist in place of a smile , made his face crooked here proceeded Fledgeby With this apostrophe Mr Fledgeby appropriately proceeded to divest himself of his Turkish garments , and invest himself with Christian attire .
