# text = Peeping about here and there , she came upon a print , a graceful head of a pretty woman , elegantly framed , hanging in the corner by the easy chair said Bella , after stopping to ruminate before it Having said which she decamped : not solely because she was offended , but because there was nothing else to look at said Bella , reappearing in the kitchen with some remains of a blush rejoined her majestic mother returned Bella , merrily searching in a dresser-drawer said Mrs Wilfer returned Bella She girded herself with a white apron , and busily with knots and pins contrived a bib to it , coming close and tight under her chin , as if it had caught her round the neck to kiss her .
