# text = Indeed , except in respect of staring about him ( a branch of the public service to which the pictorial cherub is much addicted ), this domestic cherub discharged as many odd functions as his prototype ; with the difference , say , that he performed with a blacking-brush on the family's boots , instead of performing on enormous wind instruments and double-basses , and that he conducted himself with cheerful alacrity to much useful purpose , instead of foreshortening himself in the air with the vaguest intentions .
