# text = Thus , although a room of modest situation -- for its windows gave on Silas Wegg's old corner -- and of no pretensions to velvet , satin , or gilding , it had got itself established in a domestic position analogous to that of an easy dressing-gown or pair of slippers ; and whenever the family wanted to enjoy a particularly pleasant fireside evening , they enjoyed it , as an institution that must be , in Mr Boffin's room .
