# text = Mr Boffin's station was on the opposite side said the Golden Dustman , so sharply rapping the table to bespeak his attention as Bella turned the leaves of her book , that she started returned the Secretary , with an air of some reluctance and a glance towards those others who were present said Mr Boffin , testily said the Secretary , correcting himself observed Mr Boffin , eyeing him askance said Mr Boffin With a slight inclination of his head , and a look of some surprise , the Secretary seemed to assent by forming the syllables of the word ' nonsense ' on his lips said Mr Boffin The Secretary sat down asked Mr Boffin , distrustfully Mr Boffin stipulated replied the Secretary , with an effort said Mr Boffin said Mr Boffin The Secretary bowed said Mr Boffin Again the Secretary bowed .
