# text = But without the least effect , though even Mr Fledgeby's attractions were cast into the scale said Mrs Lammle one day in the chariot said Bella , with a languid turn of her eyes returned Sophronia , shaking her head , and smiling her best smile said Bella , coolly returned Mrs Lammle Bella interposed A little vexed by a suspicion that she had spoken precipitately , and withal a little defiant of her own vexation , Bella determined not to retreat she explained replied Mrs Lammle , as if she were full of awakened feeling at the suggestion of such an impossibility Bella began again With a little short , petulant Bella complied murmured Mrs Lammle pursued Bella said Mrs Lammle , rallying her with an arch look and her best smile Now , the very grossness of this flattery put Bella upon proving that she actually did please in spite of herself .
