# text = And then called out And so with a show of much cheerful alacrity stumped out to the gate with a light , and there , through the window of a cab , descried Mr Boffin inside , blocked up with books said Mr Boffin excitedly returned the Impostor , who had caught the name imperfectly said Mr Boffin cried Mr Boffin in a bustle Not ceasing to talk and bustle , in a state of great excitement , Mr Boffin directed the removal and arrangement of the books , appearing to be in some sort beside himself until they were all deposited on the floor , and the cab was dismissed said Mr Boffin , gloating over them Mr Wegg presented his friend as Mr Venus cried Mr Boffin , catching at the name said Mr Venus cried Mr Boffin With piercing eagerness returned Venus Mr Venus , with a glance at his friend , replied in the affirmative asked Mr Boffin , putting his hands behind him , and eagerly advancing his head Mr Venus shook his head Mr Venus again shook his head said Mr Boffin .
