# text = By these steps Mr Wegg arrived at a concluding instance of the human Magpie cried Mr Boffin Mr Venus , who since his introduction to the French gentleman , had been stooping to peer up the chimney , had his attention recalled by the last sentence , and took the liberty of repeating it asked Mr Boffin , turning suddenly Mr Venus answered that he found it extremely interesting said Mr Boffin Mr Venus expressed his acknowledgments and accepted the invitation said Mr Boffin , ruminating observed Wegg , with a propitiatory face to draw him out , and with another peg at his friend and brother said Mr Boffin Mr Wegg , in a languid transport , again dropped over on Mr Venus , and again recovering himself , masked his emotions with a sneeze said Mr Boffin
