# text = He was so sudden and rough , that Wegg , who had been hovering closer and closer to his skirts , despatching the back of his hand on exploring expeditions in search of the bottle's surface , retired two or three paces said Wegg , humbly Mr Boffin eyed him as a dog might eye another dog who wanted his bone ; and actually retorted with a low growl , as the dog might have retorted he said , after having sunk into a moody silence , with his hands clasped behind him , and his eyes suspiciously wandering about Wegg Avarice , and the evening's legends of avarice , and the inflammatory effect of what he had seen , and perhaps the rush of his ill-conditioned blood to his brain in his descent , wrought Silas Wegg to such a pitch of insatiable appetite , that when the door closed he made a swoop at it and drew Venus along with him he cried said Venus , restraining him muttered Venus , sturdily , clasping him in his arms retorted Wegg
# sent_id = 2987
