# text = Mr Venus also rose said Wegg Mr Venus involuntarily smoothed his countenance , and looked at his hand , as if to see whether any of its speaking properties came off pursued Wegg , pointing his words with his forefinger said Venus returned Wegg , with a sort of joyful affability said Wegg said Venus returned Wegg , with the same joyful candour Having thus elongated and emphasized the word Surprise , Mr Wegg shook his friend and brother by both hands , and then clapped him on both knees , like an affectionate patron who entreated him not to mention so small a service as that which it had been his happy privilege to render .
