# text = This with an air of great magnanimity said Venus returned Wegg with considerable reluctance Mr Venus smote the table with his hand said Wegg After being some time absent , as if in his covetousness he could hardly make up his mind to produce the treasure to his partner , he returned with an old leathern hat-box , into which he had put the other box , for the better preservation of commonplace appearances , and for the disarming of suspicion said Silas in a low voice , looking around assented Venus Jealous of the custody of the box , and yet fearful of opening it under the existing circumstances , Wegg hesitated repeated Venus , chafing Not very well seeing his way to a refusal , Mr Wegg then rejoined in a gush So he locked up the Bower and they set forth : Mr Venus taking his arm , and keeping it with remarkable tenacity .
