# text = He and Venus were necessarily seated close together , as each held a corner of the document , which was but a common sheet of paper said Wegg , even more insinuatingly than before Venus shook his shock of hair , as he replied said Wegg , after a silence , during which they had contemplated one another Venus shook his shock of hair as he replied Silas hesitated a little longer , and then suddenly releasing his corner , and resuming his buoyant and benignant tone , exclaimed Continuing to wink his red eyes both together -- but in a self - communing way , and without any show of triumph --
