# text = That , the plan of action was that they should lie by with patience ; that , they should allow the Mounds to be gradually levelled and cleared away , while retaining to themselves their present opportunity of watching the process -- which would be , he conceived , to put the trouble and cost of daily digging and delving upon somebody else , while they might nightly turn such complete disturbance of the dust to the account of their own private investigations -- and that , when the Mounds were gone , and they had worked those chances for their own joint benefit solely , they should then , and not before , explode on the minion and worm .
