# text = Mr Wegg hinted , to jog his attention said Venus fretfully Mr Wegg , less interested than he had been , glanced at one particular shelf in the dark he said in a tone of friendly commiseration said Venus , with a despondent rise and fall of his eyes With a disappointed face , Silas mentally consigned this parrot to regions more than tropical , and , seeming for the time to have lost his power of assuming an interest in the woes of Mr Venus , fell to tightening his wooden leg as a preparation for departure : its gymnastic performances of that evening having severely tried its constitution .
