# text = But it might have done , if he could have read them he said , with an abstracted air , after a little meditation Hurriedly emptying her pocket , old Betty laid down on the table , a shilling , and two sixpenny pieces , and a few pence said the Deputy , counting the money with his eyes said the Deputy , giving her back the letter , and pocketing the coins , one by one She was gone out of the Lock-house as soon as he gave her this permission , and her tottering steps were on the road again .
