# text = The Secretary gave her such a radiant look , that if he had thanked her a hundred times , he could not have said as much as the look said repeated Bella said the Secretary , with a beaming face said Bella , giving herself an impatient little slap with her glove suggested the Secretary , finding that she stopped said Bella , with a charming air of being inclined to give herself up as a bad job observed the Secretary asked Bella , with a look of wonder returned Bella said Bella , hesitating Assenting with a movement of his head , though not at all looking as if it did , the Secretary replied said Bella , looking at him with curiosity , as not quite making him out said Bella he answered , looking steadily at her said Bella , turning away her eyes said Bella , repeating the phrase quickly , with her eyebrows raised returned the Secretary , with the same steady look Bella met the steady look for a moment with a wistful , musing little look of her own , and then , nodding her pretty head several times , like a dimpled philosopher ( of the very best school ) who was moralizing on Life , heaved a little sigh , and gave up things in general for a bad job , as she had previously been inclined to give up herself .
