# text = On her accompanying each of these reproaches with a threatening stamp of the foot , the wretched creature protested with a whine Miss Wren proceeded pleaded the absurd creature said Miss Wren , half appealing to Eugene Assuredly , in his worse than swinish state ( for swine at least fatten on their guzzling , and make themselves good to eat ), he was a pretty object for any eyes said Miss Wren , rating him with great severity cried the subject of these angry remarks pursued Miss Wren said Miss Wren , covering her eyes with her hand Obeying her , he shambled out , and Eugene Wrayburn saw the tears exude from between the little creature's fingers as she kept her hand before her eyes .
