# text = He was sorry , but his sympathy did not move his carelessness to do anything but feel sorry said Miss Wren , taking away her hand after a little while , and laughing satirically to hide that she had been crying returned Miss Wren with a hitch of her chin Her degraded charge had come back , and was standing behind her with the bonnet and shawl said Miss Wren , as she turned and espied him The miserable man , feebly rubbing the back of his faltering hands downward from the wrists , shuffled on to his post of disgrace ; but not without a curious glance at Eugene in passing him , accompanied with what seemed as if it might have been an action of his elbow , if any action of any limb or joint he had , would have answered truly to his will .
