# text = Taking no more particular notice of him than instinctively falling away from the disagreeable contact , Eugene , with a lazy compliment or so to Miss Wren , begged leave to light his cigar , and departed said Jenny , shaking her head and her emphatic little forefinger at her burden With this admonition , she blew her work candles out , leaving him to the light of the fire , and , taking her big door-key in her pocket and her crutch-stick in her hand , marched off .
