# text = He took the shovel from the grate , sprinkled a few live ashes on it , and from a box on the chimney-piece took a few pastiles , which he set upon them ; then , with great composure began placidly waving the shovel in front of Mr Dolls , to cut him off from his company cried Lightwood , laughing again said Wrayburn , very observant of his face withal said the visitor , thickly and huskily With a stupid stare Mr Dolls collapsed in his chair , and faintly said said Eugene A similar quantity was poured into his glass , and he got it to his lips by similar circuitous ways .
