# text = A man was standing there , in parley with the watchman said the watchman Perceiving himself to be the antecedent , Bradley looked from the watchman to the man the watchman explained , showing it in his hand said Bradley , glancing at the man , who was a stranger to him the man assented in a surly way As Bradley passed out at the gate with an undecided foot , he heard it shut behind him , and heard the footstep of the man coming after him said the man , who appeared to have been drinking and rather stumbled at him than touched him , to attract his attention asked Bradley returned the man , pointing backward over his right shoulder with his right thumb hooking his proposition on his left-hand fingers with the forefinger of his right said Bradley , with a frown and a distant look before him cried the man . ' Hooroar T'other t'other Governor . Hooroar T'otherest Governor !
