# text = Let's wet it , in a mouth-fill of rum and milk , T'otherest Governon ' Bradley assenting , went with him into an early public-house , haunted by unsavoury smells of musty hay and stale straw , where returning carts , farmers' men , gaunt dogs , fowls of a beery breed , and certain human nightbirds fluttering home to roost , were solacing themselves after their several manners ; and where not one of the nightbirds hovering about the sloppy bar failed to discern at a glance in the passion-wasted nightbird with respectable feathers , the worst nightbird of all .
