# text = She was resuming when he stopped her Having given her this back-handed reminder of her mutinous observations to the skeleton , Mr Lammle rose from table -- perhaps , the better to conceal a smile , and a white dint or two about his nose -- and took a turn on the carpet and came to the hearthrug As Lammle , standing gathering up the skirts of his dressing-gown with his back to the fire , said this , looking down at his wife , she turned pale and looked down at the ground .
