# text = With a sense of disloyalty upon her , and perhaps with a sense of personal danger -- for she was afraid of him -- even afraid of his hand and afraid of his foot , though he had never done her violence -- she hastened to put herself right in his eyes her husband struck in But , seeing that she was turning something in her mind , he gathered up the skirts of his dressing-gown again , and , tucking them under one arm , and collecting his ample whiskers in his other hand , kept his eye upon her , silently she said , looking up with some timidity into his face She cast about in her thoughts again , and he kept his eye upon her as before he resumed , after a fruitless silence said she , brightening a little , after more casting about observed her watchful husband , in a patronizing manner She took time and then said said Lammle she resumed , with a bitter stress upon the phrase observed Lammle , changing the leg on which he stood she pursued said Lamm
