# text = It was barely settled when a manly form was seen to pass the windows and heard to knock and ring said Lammle Adding these words under his breath , lest he should be audible in the erect ears of Mr Fledgeby , through two keyholes and the hall , Lammle , making signals of discretion to his servant , went softly up stairs said Mrs Lammle , giving him a very gracious reception Dear Mr Fledgeby did sit down , and satisfied himself ( or , judging from the expression of his countenance , DISsatisfied himself ) that nothing new had occurred in the way of whisker-sprout since he came round the corner from the Albany said Mr Fledgeby said Mrs Lammle remarked Mr Fledgeby , trying a new part of his chair said Mrs Lammle , with deep feeling said Fledgeby said Mr Fledgeby said Mr Fledgehy , with a rather uncompromising accent on his noun-substantive exclaimed Mrs Lammle , clasping her hands with a certain gushing wildness Mr Fledgeby began , and there stuck so long for a word to get on with , that Mrs Lammle offered him sweetly said Mr Fledgeby said Fledgeby said Fledgeby cried Mrs Lammle thought Fledgeby . ' I didn't see that opening , but she spies it out and cuts into it as soon as it's made Mrs Lammle went on in a very interesting manner
