# text = He looked on for a time , as the Jew filled her little basket with such scraps as she was used to buy ; but , his merry vein coming on again , he was obliged to turn round to the window once more , and lean his arms on the blind said the old man in a whisper , and with a worn-out look returned Miss Wren She shook that emphatic little forefinger of hers in his face at parting , as earnestly and reproachfully as she had ever shaken it at her grim old child at home said she Having assisted at a few more expositions of the lives of Misers , Mr Venus became almost indispensable to the evenings at the Bower .
