# text = He hesitated , and said before resuming the thread of his discourse The Golden Dustman , with his hands folded on the top of his stout stick , with his chin resting upon them , and with something leering and whimsical in his eyes , gave a nod , and said Without moving eye or finger , Mr Boffin gave another nod , and placidly repeated the penitent anatomist went on but , unwilling to press too hard upon himself , substituted with great emphasis Placid and whimsical of look as ever , Mr Boffin answered said Venus With which brief professional exordium , he entered on the history of the friendly move , and truly recounted it .
