# text = And greedily watched his partner as he turned his back again , and turned his key again said Venus , resuming his low chair behind the counter replied Wegg inquired Venus , with a glance towards the alligator's yard or two of smile cried Wegg , yielding to his honest indignation suggested Venus said Wegg said Mr Wegg , greatly exasperated urged Venus retorted Wegg assented Wegg , put into a better humour by the ready admission said Venus returned that estimable man replied Wegg Perhaps it was with the malicious intent of urging him on to his worst that Mr Venus looked as if he doubted that said Wegg , falling back upon his strongest terms of reprobation , and slapping the counter There was a grin upon the ghastly countenance of the French gentleman under the influence of the firelight , as if he were computing how many thousand slanderers and traitors array themselves against the fortunate , on premises exactly answering to those of Mr Wegg .
