# text = Mr Boffin , after eyeing him with a comical look of discomfited curiosity , was fain to begin afresh here Mr Boffin clapped a finger against his nose , and tapped it several times with a sneaking air , as embodying Rokesmith confidentially confabulating with his own nose said Mr Boffin , addressing Rokesmith himself with ridiculous inconsistency began the Secretary said Mr Boffin said Mr Boffin , with a snap of his fingers expostulated his wife returned Mr Boffin said the Secretary retorted Mr Boffin , with a sly look remarked the Secretary , waving the point aside with his hand said Mr Boffin demanded the Secretary answered Mr Boffin said Mr Boffin , obstinately cried poor Mrs Boffin , not to be quite repressed said her husband , but without harshness replied Mr Boffin said the Secretary , in a low voice cried Mr Boffin , with a cunning wink pursued the Secretary , without deigning to notice him said Mr Boffin , by way of commentary , with another wink the Secretary went on , still without heeding him remarked the Secretary , looking full at his late master asked Mr Boffin , turning to his wife in a bantering tone returned the Secretary , with another full look laughed Mr Boffin . ' There's nothing like a good said the Secretary , turning from him and falling into his former manner said Mr Boffin , with a deep look Mr Boffin pointed at the culprit , as it were in the act , and hugged himself in his great penetration said Mr Boffin Bella my dear made no response , gave no sign of acquiescence .
