# text = But , Mr Boffin stopped her with a gesture , and she obediently sat down again and stayed where she was said the Golden Dustman , jerking the folded scrap of paper he had in his hand , towards his late Secretary Rokesmith answered as he took it from the ground said Mr Boffin said Mr Boffin returned Rokesmith said Mr Boffin , laying his hand protectingly on Bella's head without looking down at her retorted Mr Boffin , with ineffable contempt John Rokesmith stared at him in his outburst , as if with some faint idea that he had gone mad said Mr Boffin returned Mr Boffin said Rokesmith , quietly turning to her said Mr Boffin , laying his hand on Bella's head again But , Bella was so far from appearing to feel it , that she shrank from his hand and from the chair , and , starting up in an incoherent passion of tears , and stretching out her arms , cried So , crying out in a wild way that she could not bear this , Bella drooped her head on Mrs Boffin's ready breast .
