# text = Then Mr Boffin observed in a soothing and comfortable tone Which Mr Boffin repeated with a highly satisfied air of completeness and finality cried Bella , turning suddenly upon him , with a stamp of her little foot exclaimed Mr Boffin in an amazed under-tone cried Bella Mr Boffin stared here , and stared there , as misdoubting that he must be in some sort of fit said Bella Mr Boffin , seeming to become convinced that this was a fit , rolled his eyes and loosened his neckcloth cried Bella Having shot this bolt out with a great expenditure of force , Bella hysterically laughed and cried together said Bella , returning to the charge After despatching this second bolt with a still greater expenditure of force , Bella laughed and cried still more
