# text = Appearing now to think that he was coming to , he stared straight before him for a while , tied his neckerchief again , took several long inspirations , swallowed several times , and ultimately exclaimed with a deep sigh , as if he felt himself on the whole better No word , good or bad , did Mrs Boffin say ; but she tenderly took care of Bella , and glanced at her husband as if for orders .
