# text = Mr Boffin , without imparting any , took his seat on a chair over against them , and there sat leaning forward , with a fixed countenance , his legs apart , a hand on each knee , and his elbows squared , until Bella should dry her eyes and raise her head , which in the fulness of time she did said Bella , rising hurriedly remonstrated Mrs Boffin said Bella This to Mr Boffin urged Mrs Boffin said Mr Boffin cried Bella , cutting him short , with intense defiance in her expressive little eyebrows , and championship of the late Secretary in every dimple proceeded Bella , breaking into tears again the Golden Dustman slowly remonstrated said Bella Very pretty she looked , though very angry , as she made herself as tall as she possibly could ( which was not extremely tall ), and utterly renounced her patron with a lofty toss of her rich brown head said Bella cried Mr Boffin , staring said Bella After which strong avowal Bella underwent reaction , and cried to any extent , with her face on the back of her chair said Mr Boffin , as soon as he could find an opening for breaking the silence and striking in said Bella resumed the Golden Dustman cried Bella , rising hurriedly again Mr Boffin reasoned said Bella argued Mr Boffin said Bella Mr Boffin pursued said Bella , haughtily
# sent_id = 3527
