# text = Bella took the bit off , and put it in her mouth said her father Regardless of Bella's dissuasions he ran out , and quickly returned with the new supply he said , as he spread it on another piece of paper before her and then looked at her figure , and stopped short he resumed more slowly said the cherub , giving himself a little shake , as if to rouse his faculties he returned , swallowing a bit of the cottage loaf with considerable effort , for it seemed to stick by the way said Bella , moving coaxingly to his side instead of remaining opposite suggested Bella , sorrowfully said her father , quite contented to accept the phrase .
