# text = When did you begin to feel timid , Lavvy ? inquired Bella , with a smile replied the Irrepressible Whether the Irrepressible felt slighted by Bella's declaration that she would not quarrel , or whether her spitefulness was evoked by Bella's return to the sphere of Mr George Sampson's courtship , or whether it was a necessary fillip to her spirits that she should come into collision with somebody on the present occasion ,-- anyhow she made a dash at her stately parent now , with the greatest impetuosity said Mrs Wilfer said Mrs Wilfer returned Lavvy , folding her arms and leaning back in her chair said Mrs Wilfer said Lavvy proclaimed Mrs Wilfer returned Lavinia coolly Lavinia's engineering having made this crooked opening at Bella , Mrs Wilfer strode into it said Lavinia exclaimed Mrs Wilfer , with sublime severity returned the unmoved Irrepressible returned Lavinia pursued her mother Lavinia was about replying to her honoured parent that she might as well have dispensed with her looks altogether then , when Bella rose and said
