# text = Do what Bradley Headstone would , he could not keep that former flush of impatience out of his face , or so master his eyes as to prevent their again looking anxiously up the river said Riderhood said Bradley said Riderhood Bradley admitted with another anxious look up the river said Riderhood said Bradley , kneeling on one knee on the grass beside the Lock-keeper said Riderhood repeated Riderhood , with an angry oath Bradley turned away his haggard face for a few moments , and then said , tearing up a tuft of grass cried Riderhood said Bradley , with an effort at self-repression that forced him to wipe his face answered Riderhood , with sullen ferocity cried Bradley Riderhood , looking fixedly at him , gradually arose from his recumbent posture while the schoolmaster said these words with the utmost concentration of rage and hatred .
