# text = So , when the words were all spoken , he too kneeled on one knee on the grass , and the two men looked at one another said Riderhood , very deliberately spitting out the grass he had been chewing answered Bradley said Bradley , with a clutch at the breast of his coarse shirt with a blow or a stab at the sky retorted Riderhood , completely ridding himself of his grass , and drawing his sleeve across his mouth said Bradley , in a low voice , bending forward to lay his hand upon the Lock-keeper's shoulder muttered Riderhood , with his eyes on the passion-wasted face . '
