# text = Mrs Lammie turned to him laughingly said Mr Boffin A very remarkable wavering between two bearings -- between her propitiatory bearing there , and her defiant bearing at Mr Twemlow's -- was observable on the part of Mrs Lammle as she said replied Mr Boffin , nodding his head soothingly , as who should say , We won't be harder on you than we can help ; we'll make the best of it Mrs Lammle , settling into her defiant manner , pushed her plate away , looked at her husband , and laughed ; but by no means gaily inquired Mr Boffin replied Alfred , showing all his teeth
