# text = It would not have been very evident why he thanked the anatomist , but for his furnishing the explanation in what he went on to say Mr Venus shook the proffered hand with a modest air , and they pursued the direction of the Bower inquired Mr Boffin , wistfully , as they went along returned that personage hinted Mr Venus , delicately said Mr Boffin Mr Boffin took his nose in his hand , as if it were already excoriated , and the sparks were beginning to fly out of that feature Mr Venus replied with the assurance that he would ; and Mr Boffin , looking anxious and dispirited , pursued the way in silence until they rang at the Bower gate .
