# text = It was a pleasant sight , in the midst of the golden bloom , to see this salt old Gruff and Glum , waving his shovel hat at Bella , while his thin white hair flowed free , as if she had once more launched him into blue water again said Bella Answered Gruff and Glum So it was done to the general contentment ; and if Gruff and Glum didn't in the course of the afternoon splice the main brace , it was not for want of the means of inflicting that outrage on the feelings of the Infant Bands of Hope .
