# text = The Archbishop instantly ejected and excommunicated him ; but the thing was done said his Grace , returning alone With that , he solemnly bowed and retired , and they all burst into laughter , long and merry said Bella Her husband feeling it necessary at this point to demand one of those mysterious disappearances on Bella's part , she dutifully obeyed ; saying in a softened voice from her place of concealment Bella remaining invisible and silent , her father remained at his dessert and wine , until he remembered it was time for him to get home to Holloway he cherubically added cried John said the cherub , inaudibly addressing , in his Anglo - Saxon tendency to throw his feelings into the form of a speech , the boys down below , who were bidding against each other to put their heads in the mud for sixpence Having thus concluded his address , the amiable cherub embraced his daughter , and took his flight to the steamboat which was to convey him to London , and was then lying at the floating pier , doing its best to bump the same to bits .
