# text = But , the happy couple were not going to part with him in that way , and before he had been on board two minutes , there they were , looking down at him from the wharf above cried Bella , beckoning him with her parasol to approach the side , and bending gracefully to whisper Half laughing at him and half crying to him , Bella besought him in the prettiest manner ; in a manner so engaging and so playful and so natural , that her cherubic parent made a coaxing face as if she had never grown up , and said So , she leaning on her husband's arm , they turned homeward by a rosy path which the gracious sun struck out for them in its setting .
