# text = It was always pleasantly droll to see Pa and Bella together ; but on this present evening her husband thought her more than usually fantastic with him said Bella replied the cherub , smiling and rubbing his hands as she sat him down in his chair said Bella said the cherub , after a little consideration retorted Bella rejoined her father Which his face confirmed said Bella said Bella , looking at her father's hand and lightly slapping it said her father cried Bella , taking him by the front of his coat The cherub , to his genial amusement , was accordingly conducted to a little washing-room , where Bella soaped his face and rubbed his face , and soaped his hands and rubbed his hands , and splashed him and rinsed him and towelled him , until he was as red as beet - root , even to his very ears said Bella , busily Her father being more than willing to obey , she dressed his hair in her most elaborate manner , brushing it out straight , parting it , winding it over her fingers , sticking it up on end , and constantly falling back on John to get a good look at the effect of it .
