# text = So , in the rosy evening , one might watch the ever-widening beauty of the landscape -- beyond the newly-released workers wending home -- beyond the silver river -- beyond the deep green fields of corn , so prospering , that the loiterers in their narrow threads of pathway seemed to float immersed breast-high -- beyond the hedgerows and the clumps of trees -- beyond the windmills on the ridge -- away to where the sky appeared to meet the earth , as if there were no immensity of space between mankind and Heaven .
