# text = On a certain day , Miss Wren was alone at her work , with the house-door set open for coolness , and was trolling in a small sweet voice a mournful little song which might have been the song of the doll she was dressing , bemoaning the brittleness and meltability of wax , when whom should she descry standing on the pavement , looking in at her , but Mr Fledgeby said Fledgeby , coming up the two steps Miss Wren retorted said Fledgeby replied Miss Wren Fledgeby's small eyes opened so wide that they might have passed for ordinary-sized eyes , as he stared about him for the very young person whom he supposed to be in question said Miss Wren Mr Fledgeby replied .
