# text = At length he said was Miss Wren's cool answer said Fledgeby , bestowing an inveigling twinkle or two upon the dressmaker said Miss Jenny , holding out her doll at arm's length , and critically contemplating the effect of her art with her scissors on her lips and her head thrown back , as if her interest lay there , and not in the conversation Having addressed the last remark to her fair client , Miss Wren proceeded to snip at some blue fragments that lay before her , among fragments of all colours , and to thread a needle from a skein of blue silk said Fledgeby replied Miss Wren , without the slightest appearance of so doing said Fledgeby , rather discouraged by the circumstances under which he found himself pursuing the conversation remarked Miss Wren , in a sprightly tone proceeded Fledgeby thought the dressmaker pursued Fledgeby returned the dressmaker with many knowing nods said Fledgeby approvingly said Fledgeby with a wink returned the dressmaker , with her eyes upon her work said Fledgeby Mr Fledgeby said this with some display of indignant warmth , as if he was counsel in the cause for Virtue began the dressmaker said Fledgeby said Fledgeby cried Miss Jenny Mr Fledgeby explained , a little put out Mr Fledgeby's constructive powers were not equal to the avoidance of some tautology here Miss Jenny Wren , who had cast her eyes upon the bench again after her last interruption , sat looking at it , needle in hand but not working , for some moments .
