# text = With a weird little laugh , Miss Jenny pointed to her crutch-stick as her equipage cried Fledgeby , rising said the dolls' dressmaker , dabbing two dabs at him with her needle , as if she put out both his eyes returned Fledgeby Mr Fledgeby's prepossessing form withdrew itself ; and the little dressmaker , clipping and snipping and stitching , and stitching and snipping and clipping , fell to work at a great rate ; musing and muttering all the time Thereupon , the little dressmaker again dabbed out his eyes separately , and making a loop in the air of her thread and deftly catching it into a knot with her needle , seemed to bowstring him into the bargain .
