# text = She then shut the bedroom door , and all the other doors , and going down stairs and emerging from the Albany into the busy streets , took omnibus for Saint Mary Axe : pressing on the road all the gaily-dressed ladies whom she could see from the window , and making them unconscious lay-figures for dolls , while she mentally cut them out and basted them Set down by the omnibus at the corner of Saint Mary Axe , and trusting to her feet and her crutch-stick within its precincts , the dolls' dressmaker proceeded to the place of business of Pubsey and Co .
