# text = Now , the bad child having been strictly charged by his parent to remain at home in her absence , of course went out ; and , being in the very last stage of mental decrepitude , went out with two objects ; firstly , to establish a claim he conceived himself to have upon any licensed victualler living , to be supplied with threepennyworth of rum for nothing ; and secondly , to bestow some maudlin remorse on Mr Eugene Wrayburn , and see what profit came of it .
