# text = As the old man , Riah , sat by , helping her in such small ways as he could , he found it difficult to make out whether she really did realize that the deceased had been her father she would say thought the old man the dressmaker would go on shaking her head over her work , and dropping tears she would reply with a shrug With such talk , mostly in a cheerful tone on the part of the industrious little creature , the day-work and the night-work were beguiled until enough of smart dolls had gone forth to bring into the kitchen , where the working-bench now stood , the sombre stuff that the occasion required , and to bring into the house the other sombre preparations said Miss Jenny
