# text = In a few moments the black bonnet and the crutch-stick were on duty , the good Jew was left in possession of the house , and the dolls' dressmaker , side by side in a chaise with Mortimer Lightwood , was posting out of town A darkened and hushed room ; the river outside the windows flowing on to the vast ocean ; a figure on the bed , swathed and bandaged and bound , lying helpless on its back , with its two useless arms in splints at its sides .
