# text = If the Golden Dustman's riches had been his to stake , he would have staked them to the last farthing on the fidelity through good and evil of her affectionate and trusting heart said Bella , springing up He gaily complied , and she tied her dimpled chin up , and shook her head into her bonnet , and pulled out the bows of her bonnet - strings , and got her gloves on , finger by finger , and finally got them on her little plump hands , and bade him good-bye and went down .
