# text = The world might have been challenged to produce another baby who had such a store of pleasant nonsense said and sung to it , as Bella said and sung to this baby ; or who was dressed and undressed as often in four-and-twenty hours as Bella dressed and undressed this baby ; or who was held behind doors and poked out to stop its father's way when he came home , as this baby was ; or , in a word , who did half the number of baby things , through the lively invention of a gay and proud young mother , that this inexhaustible baby did .
