# text = Julius Handford , who had been publicly entreated to appear , and for intelligence of whom a reward had been publicly offered said Lightwood to Bella , delicately said Rokesmith , quietly Bella looked from the one to the other , in amazement pursued her husband was all the reply said Lightwood hesitating , with another glance towards Bella Bella caught her husband by the hand added Rokesmith said Lightwood Lightwood stood irresolute , but Bella's husband passed him in the steadiest manner , with Bella on his arm ; and they went home without encountering any further remonstrance or molestation from any one .
