# text = But , he was sitting thoughtfully smiling at that broad brown hand of his , and either didn't see it , or would take no notice of it repeated Mrs Boffin Bella caught Mr Boffin's twinkling eye for half an instant ; but he got it away from her , and restored it to his broad brown hand said Mrs Boffin , shaking her head with a hearty laugh and an embrace cried Mrs Boffin , in an ecstacy of admiration Bella looked half frightened , and yet half laughed pursued Mrs Boffin Mr Boffin , with his face bent over his heavy hand , made no sound , but rolled his shoulders when thus referred to , as if he were vastly enjoying himself pursued Mrs Boffin
