# text = At this , Mrs Boffin fairly screamed with rapture , and sat beating her feet upon the floor , clapping her hands , and bobbing herself backwards and forwards , like a demented member of some Mandarin's family cried Bella said Mr Boffin cried Bella , holding him prisoner by the coat with both hands Mr Boffin declared in a state of the highest enjoyment returned Bella , giving him two pulls and one kiss said Mr Boffin , one broad piece of sunshine from head to foot returned Bella said Mr Boffin said Bella said Mr Boffin Bella , who was still on her knees at Mr Boffin's feet , gradually sank down into a sitting posture on the ground , as she meditated more and more thoughtfully , with her eyes upon his beaming face said Bella , after this meditative pause asked Bella , turning to her returned Mrs Boffin , with a most rotund and glowing negative said Bella cried Mr Boffin , shaking his head with an admiring air asked Bella said Mr Boffin Mrs Boffin laughed heartily at herself ; but a certain glistening in her honest eyes revealed that she was by no means cured of that dangerous propensity said Mr Boffin Mrs Boffin laughed heartily again , and her eyes glistened again , and it then appeared , not only that in that burst of sarcastic eloquence Mr Boffin was considered by his two fellow - conspirators to have outdone himself , but that in his own opinion it was a remarkable achievement he observed to Bella Mrs Boffin reminded Bella cried Bella , covering her face with her hands
# sent_id = 4599
