# text = This circumstance appeared , in his then state of mind , to give Mr Wegg uncommon offence said Wegg , missing the usual dusty shock said Wegg , with culminating discontent said Venus , smiling in a sprightly manner retorted Wegg said Venus grumbled Wegg said Venus , contemplating his figure with an artist's eye Mr Wegg , glancing in great dudgeon towards the French gentleman's corner , seemed to notice something new there , which induced him to glance at the opposite corner , and then to put on his glasses and stare at all the nooks and corners of the dim shop in succession he exclaimed Silas took off his glasses again -- finding himself too intensely disgusted by the sprightly appearance of his friend and partner to bear a magnified view of him and made the inquiry said Venus , with a sudden flush of wrath exclaimed Wegg , testily said Venus said Wegg returned Venus with dignity asked Silas said Venus , with another flush Wegg reluctantly demanded , constraining his ill temper in remembrance of the partnership and its stock in trade returned Venus said Silas said Venus interrupted Wegg pursued Venus observed Wegg , with a touch of distrust that gentleman answered , in a tone of placid mystery said Wegg , after eyeing him with another touch of distrust Ten to-morrow morning would quite suit Mr Venus for that excellent purpose said Silas .
