# text = Who , untying his tied-up broken head , revealed a head that was whole , and a face that was Sloppy's roared Sloppy in a peal of laughter , and with immeasureable relish Here , Mr Sloppy opening his mouth to a quite alarming extent , and throwing back his head to peal again , revealed incalculable buttons said Wegg , slightly discomfited , but not much as yet remonstrated Sloppy , jerking his head forward Mr Boffin appeased him with a wave of his hand , and said replied Mr Boffin , sitting composedly on the library-table , at one end , while the Secretary sat composedly on it at the other repeated Wegg said Mr Boffin , shaking his head good-humouredly Wegg reflected a moment , and then said replied Venus , handing it to him with much politeness Mr Wegg , who , as if anticipating a compliment , had been beating time with the paper to the other's politeness until this unexpected conclusion came upon him , stopped rather abruptly said Venus , ' know that I took the liberty of taking Mr Boffin into our concern as a sleeping partner , at a very early period of our firm's existence added Mr Boffin Venus remarked said Mr Boffin Venus inclined his head with respect and gratitude
