# text = At the miserable master's nod , the shrill chorus arose cried Riderhood Another tossing of arms , another nod , and another shrill chorus said Riderhood , after attentively listening , and internally repeating Shrill chorus said Riderhood , ' with a person of about your own heighth and breadth , and wot With a desperation in him that made him perfectly quiet , though his jaw was heavily squared ; with his eyes upon Riderhood ; and with traces of quickened breathing in his nostrils ; the schoolmaster replied , in a suppressed voice , after a pause With a half glance around him at his pupils , Bradley returned said Riderhood , with a laugh asked Riderhood said Riderhood pursued Riderhood , changing his hoarse tone and leering round upon the class again said Bradley , always sustaining his dark look at the other , and speaking in his suppressed voice cried Riderhood Shrill chorus said Riderhood Shrill chorus ( with some contempt for the ease of the question said Riderhood Chorus at a loss .
